  "changelog": "**🆕 MudaRemote v4.10.9**\n\n### ✨ New Features\n- **Auto `$oq`:** The bot can now play your `$oq` boards. It works out where the purple spheres can be from the clues and goes for the 3 purples that turn the last one red.\n- **Auto `$ot`:** The bot can now play your `$ot` boards. Only blue costs a click there, so it follows the color lines and avoids blue as much as it can.\n\nTurn them on under Power & Expert Settings. Both are off by default.\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- **No More Broken APK Download:** Fetch app updates could say a new APK was available and send you to a page that didn't exist. The bot code still updates on its own like before, and the app now only mentions an APK that's really there.\n- **APK Downloads From Switch Version:** With the next Android app, releases that come with an APK show \"+ APK\" in Switch Version, where you can choose to update the bot code or download the APK.\n\nRestart the bot after updating.",
